# Secrets: real per-environment config files must never be baked into image
# layers (VOLUME ["/app/config"] overrides them at runtime anyway — only
# config.example.json and config.schema.json, which hold no secrets, should
# ship in the image).
config/config.dev.json
config/config.prod.json
config/config.test.json

